---
description: Select the candidate supported by original bytes and decide authorized private next action.
args:
  goal: string
  plan: ImagePlan
  assessment: ImageAssessment
  reads: ImageRead[]
returns: ImageDecision
---
Use the native original observations to resolve what is actually safe to use. Distinguish a fully saved valid candidate from a preview, a missing original, and an unreadable or inconsistent original. For historical requests only consider the exact requested variant. For comparisons explain what changes eligibility and respect an explicit request to choose only the current output. Choose hold when no candidate meets the request, report for read-only decisions, or stage only for the user-authorized private local handoff with sufficient rights. Include an exact verified candidate ID when applicable, a concrete explanation tied to the retained evidence.
